# Build outputs, VCS data and generated media are never inputs to the image. The recursive patterns
# matter: the vendored app trees carry their own target/ and node_modules/ directories.
**/target/
**/node_modules/
**/.git/
dist/
artifacts/
deploy/backups/
**/.freebuff/
secrets/

# Media under crates/cad-studio/assets must NOT be excluded: lib.rs embeds the flight video and its
# poster with include_bytes!, so a `**/*.mp4` rule breaks the build.
